<i>♪ We got it down... ♪</i>

966
00:59:30.583 --> 00:59:32.208
<i>♪ Gonna get down now ♪</i>

967
00:59:32.291 --> 00:59:34.000
<i>♪ Gonna get around ♪</i>

968
00:59:35.000 --> 00:59:37.916
<i>♪ Work it, work it again now</i>...<i> ♪</i>

969
00:59:40.625 --> 00:59:43.500
<i>♪ We're gonna get, gonna get down now ♪</i>

970
